            {"binding":null,"casilla_id":"provisiones-gastos-dificil-justificacion","data_type":"money","form_number":null,"formula":"modelo-130-provisiones-gastos-dificil-justificacion","help_text":"Simplified direct estimation only: the percentage set by article 30 of the IRPF Regulation on your cumulative income less your deductible expenses, up to its annual limit. It is zero when that difference is negative.","input_kind":"computed","label":"Deductible provisions and hard-to-justify expenses","legal_refs":["rd-439-2007:art-30","ley-35-2006:art-30","ley-35-2006:da-56","rd-439-2007:art-110"],"number":"provisiones-gastos-dificil-justificacion","required":false,"section":["actividades_economicas_estimacion_directa"],"source_refs":["aeat-modelo-130-instructions"]},
            {"binding":null,"casilla_id":"rendimiento-neto-reducible-art-32-1","data_type":"money","form_number":null,"formula":null,"help_text":"The part of the cumulative net income generated over more than two years or notoriously irregular, imputed in a single period. Leave it out if your activity regularly obtains such income. Box 03 is calculated after reducing it by 30%, on at most 300,000 euros a year.","input_kind":"manual","label":"Net income qualifying for the art. 32.1 reduction","legal_refs":["ley-35-2006:art-32-2015"],"number":"rendimiento-neto-reducible-art-32-1","required":false,"section":["actividades_economicas_estimacion_directa"],"source_refs":["aeat-modelo-130-instructions"]},
            {"binding":null,"casilla_id":"03","data_type":"money","form_number":null,"formula":"modelo-130-rendimiento-neto","help_text":"Net yield from direct-estimation economic activities, calculated as income minus expenses.","input_kind":"computed","label":"Net yield","legal_refs":["rd-439-2007:art-110","orden-eha-672-2007:art-1","ley-35-2006:art-99","rd-439-2007:art-95","ley-35-2006:art-28","ley-35-2006:art-30"],"number":"03","required":false,"section":["actividades_economicas_estimacion_directa"],"source_refs":["aeat-dr-130-2019-v12","aeat-modelo-130-instructions"]},
